{% set local_problem %}
<p>Surface drainage has limits. Splash blocks move water only a few feet. Above-ground extensions get damaged and look unsightly. During heavy storms, surface discharge can't keep up.</p>

<p>Underground drains solve all of this. They capture water at each downspout and carry it through buried pipes to safe discharge points far from your home.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Underground drains include catch basins at each downspout, solid PVC pipe buried with proper slope, and discharge points at safe locations away from structures.</p>
{% endset %}

